{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は学校の友達と原宿に行ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容室にもいったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後で知ったんだけど、同じ日に、\n川後ひなちゃん\n＆\n川村まひろちゃん\n＆\n樋口ひなちゃん\n＆\n衛藤みさちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんないたそうです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑\nスイーツも沢山食べたよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントで教えてもらえてる事を自分にとりいれて、もっともっと成長していきたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な女性、アイドルになれるよう頑張るぞ〜!!\nまあや族になってもいいですか？とのコメントを読むと本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても勇気とパワーをもらえます\nもっともっと頑張りますので宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑\nだいぶ前の写真です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもお茶目なゆったんたんです\nこの前せいらりんとおうちに遊びに来てくれた時..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人でビデオを見てたの\nそしたら、\nゆったんたんがまあやの耳をず〜と触ってるの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんはお尻だけじゃなく耳もラブだったのね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※ここ最近テストで追試がなく、順調に勉強がはかどっているまあやより(英語も順調なのよー！笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読み逃げ禁止だぞ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/3730688/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}